part.text:
Done.

**Preflight:** `pwd` → `/workspace`, `git rev-parse --show-toplevel` → `/workspace`, `git rev-parse HEAD` → `96b308a20980554af509a525430daddfaa4b670e` — all match. `zg query --fts function --limit 1` returned 1 hit (`src/utils.cjs:1-3`).

**Change:** Implemented `clampDelay` in `src/utils.cjs`:

```js
function clampDelay(value) {
  return Math.min(5000, Math.max(100, value));
}
```

This clamps to the inclusive range 100–5000. I verified the boundaries and out-of-range values (`50→100`, `100→100`, `2500→2500`, `5000→5000`, `9999→5000`, negatives/0→100, and in-range decimals preserved) — all pass.
